                    Dear Hiring Manager,
                </p>

                <p>
                    I am writing to express my interest in a technology-focused position
                    within your organization. I have experience supporting
                    <strong>mission-critical network environments</strong> and working
                    with networking equipment, security tools, and enterprise systems.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <p>
                    My background includes troubleshooting network issues, monitoring
                    systems, following security requirements, and supporting users in
                    high-pressure environments. I am currently working toward a degree
                    in <em>Computer Science</em>, which is helping me expand my skills
                    in programming and software development.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I believe my experience in networking and cybersecurity would allow
                    me to contribute to your team. I am especially interested in roles
                    where I can continue learning while helping maintain reliable and
                    secure systems.
                </p>

                <p>
                    <mark>I am motivated, dependable, and eager to grow in the technology field.</mark>
                </p>

                <p>
                    Thank you for your time and consideration. I would appreciate the
                    opportunity to discuss how my experience and skills could benefit
                    your organization.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Sincerely,
                    <br>
                    <span>Ernesto Cota</span>
                </p>
